<Slide style={{
    width: 1280,
    height: 720,
    padding: '0 72px',
    background: '#FFFFFF',
}}>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 720, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Box style={{
            height: 120,
            paddingTop: 20,
            paddingBottom: 16,
            flexDirection: 'column',
            justifyContent: 'flex-end',
        }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 6, background: '#97C459', marginBottom: 14 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0B1F1A' }}>
                What is new, and what we did not solve
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 712, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 13, color: '#0F6E56', letterSpacing: 1.6 }}>
                    INNOVATION HIGHLIGHTS
                </Text>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, marginTop: 18 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 17, color: '#97C459', width: 30 }}>01</Text>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#04342C' }}>
                            Selective branch cancellation
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 15.5, lineHeight: 1.5, color: '#0B1F1A', marginTop: 4 }}>
                            The dependency that matters is normally invisible. Fingerprinting it turns “cancel the stale work” from a
                            heuristic into a decision with a reason.
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, marginTop: 14 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 17, color: '#97C459', width: 30 }}>02</Text>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#04342C' }}>
                            An audit log that proves its own guarantee
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 15.5, lineHeight: 1.5, color: '#0B1F1A', marginTop: 4 }}>
                            It records the effect when it lands, not only when a retry replays it. We found that gap by trying to read
                            the guarantee out of the log.
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, marginTop: 14 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 17, color: '#97C459', width: 30 }}>03</Text>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#04342C' }}>
                            A fast path that cannot cheat
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 15.5, lineHeight: 1.5, color: '#0B1F1A', marginTop: 4 }}>
                            The acknowledgement passes the same ungrounded-claim audit as anything else said mid-retrieval. Speed is
                            not permitted to become a loophole.
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, marginTop: 14 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 17, color: '#97C459', width: 30 }}>04</Text>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#04342C' }}>
                            Visual grounding with honest limits
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 15.5, lineHeight: 1.5, color: '#0B1F1A', marginTop: 4 }}>
                            Requirements the database cannot enforce are reported as unenforceable — never described as a filter that
                            was applied.
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, marginTop: 14 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 17, color: '#97C459', width: 30 }}>05</Text>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#04342C' }}>
                            A deterministic benchmark
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 15.5, lineHeight: 1.5, color: '#0B1F1A', marginTop: 4 }}>
                            Branch lifecycle runs on a virtual clock, so a cancellation latency is a measurement rather than a
                            coincidence.
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{
                width: 384,
                background: '#E1F5EE',
                padding: '24px 24px 20px 24px',
                flexDirection: 'column',
            }}>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 13, color: '#0F6E56', letterSpacing: 1.6 }}>
                    LIMITATIONS
                </Text>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, marginTop: 16 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 5, background: '#0F6E56' }} />
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#04342C' }}>Public corpus</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.4, color: '#0B1F1A', marginTop: 2 }}>
                            A transformed public recruitment dataset. Retrieval numbers describe this dataset only.
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, marginTop: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 5, background: '#0F6E56' }} />
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#04342C' }}>Simulated benchmark</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.4, color: '#0B1F1A', marginTop: 2 }}>
                            It proves control behaviour — what was cancelled, preserved, deduplicated — not database performance at scale.
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, marginTop: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 5, background: '#0F6E56' }} />
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#04342C' }}>Rule-based image parser</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.4, color: '#0B1F1A', marginTop: 2 }}>
                            Handles requirement extraction well but will not generalise to arbitrary layouts. That interface is where a
                            vision model plugs in.
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, marginTop: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 5, background: '#0F6E56' }} />
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#04342C' }}>Inherited ranking quality</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.4, color: '#0B1F1A', marginTop: 2 }}>
                            This work neither claims nor measures an improvement in retrieval ranking.
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, marginTop: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 5, background: '#0F6E56' }} />
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#04342C' }}>Local fast path</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.4, color: '#0B1F1A', marginTop: 2 }}>
                            The 250 ms budget is met because the sentence is generated locally. A hosted model would need its own budget.
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{
            height: 60,
            paddingBottom: 20,
            flexDirection: 'row',
            alignItems: 'center',
            justifyContent: 'space-between',
        }}>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 14, color: '#6B7280' }}>
                Talent Atlas · Samsung PRISM Y2026 · Theme 05
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 14, color: '#6B7280' }}>
                11 / 12
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
